### Case: identity-enforced — no Authorization header.
### Expect 401.
###
### This is the most consequential check in the package. A 200 here does not break
### the API — it silently makes per-app analytics impossible for this route,
### permanently, for all data captured while it stays that way. Every row will
### attribute to a source IP, and partners share NAT gateways, run in clouds, and
### rotate egress addresses.
GET {{GATEWAY}}/orders
accept: application/json
